WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.000
In the last years of the Eastern Han, the realm fell into chaos, and the people knew no peace.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.200
Liu Bei, Guan Yu, and Zhang Fei swore brotherhood in the Peach Garden, vowing to the death to restore the Han.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.900
For the people of all under heaven, they would forge a new future.

